    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just waiting for it to be over. like, every day is just a struggle to get through the hours until i can sleep again. it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just... not be here. to stop fighting the emptiness. do you think it's wrong to just want to be with him?",
